<title>USA: BellSouth Capital Funding sets $300 mln debentures.</title>
<headline>BellSouth Capital Funding sets $300 mln debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from BellSouth Capital Funding was priced on Friday, via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER BELLSOUTH CAPITAL FUNDING</p>
<p>AMT $300		     COUPON 6.04 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE PUTABLE DEBTENURES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA1	   YIELD  6.04 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA		 SPREAD N.A.	 PUTABLE IN THE 5TH</p>
<p>							   AND 10TH YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
